Daydream — a Yapfast theme

Everything in this theme except the fonts is original work, dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/):

- theme.json and the preview pictures in previews/
- art/ — the sky, the two cumulus layers and the gloss/frost sheets, all
  generated procedurally (numpy); no photographs or third-party images
- sounds/ — every sound synthesised from sine waves and filtered noise
  (bubble, droplet and glass-chime recipes); no samples
- icons/ — an original icon set drawn for this theme

It ships two fonts, each under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
(https://openfontlicense.org). Their full licence texts are in fonts/:

- fonts/Nunito.ttf — Nunito (variable, wght 200–1000)
  Copyright 2014 The Nunito Project Authors (https://github.com/googlefonts/nunito)
  Licence: fonts/OFL-Nunito.txt

- fonts/JetBrainsMono.ttf — JetBrains Mono (variable, wght 100–800)
  Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono)
  Licence: fonts/OFL-JetBrainsMono.txt

The fonts are unmodified and are not sold on their own.
